### Create versioned indices. Switch aliases only after all loads and checks pass.
PUT http://127.0.0.1:9200/umls-search-documents-v1
Content-Type: application/json

< ./search-documents-index.json

###
PUT http://127.0.0.1:9200/umls-concepts-v1
Content-Type: application/json

< ./concepts-index.json

###
PUT http://127.0.0.1:9200/umls-relations-v1
Content-Type: application/json

< ./relations-index.json

###
PUT http://127.0.0.1:9200/umls-search-details-v1
Content-Type: application/json

< ./search-details-index.json

### Exact CUI lookup
GET http://127.0.0.1:9200/umls-concepts/_doc/C0018801

### Exact normalized label lookup
POST http://127.0.0.1:9200/umls-concepts/_search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "size": 20,
  "query": {
    "term": {
      "label_norms": "heart failure"
    }
  },
  "_source": [
    "cui",
    "preferred_label",
    "semantic_types",
    "semantic_groups"
  ]
}

### Exact source-qualified code lookup
POST http://127.0.0.1:9200/umls-concepts/_search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "size": 20,
  "query": {
    "nested": {
      "path": "codes",
      "query": {
        "bool": {
          "filter": [
            { "term": { "codes.sab": "RXNORM" } },
            { "term": { "codes.code_norm": "12345" } },
            { "term": { "codes.suppressed": false } }
          ]
        }
      },
      "inner_hits": {
        "size": 10
      }
    }
  }
}

### SapBERT kNN lookup. Replace the query_vector with exactly 768 normalized floats.
POST http://127.0.0.1:9200/umls-search-documents/_search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "size": 60,
  "knn": {
    "field": "vector",
    "query_vector": [0.0],
    "k": 60,
    "num_candidates": 100
  },
  "_source": {
    "excludes": [
      "vector",
      "text"
    ]
  }
}

### Batch-hydrate winning search documents after collapsing candidates by CUI.
POST http://127.0.0.1:9200/umls-search-details/_mget
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ids": [
    "C0018801:pubmed_clinical_context",
    "C0018802:pmc_oa_clinical_context"
  ]
}

### Fetch outbound and inbound relationships in one request.
POST http://127.0.0.1:9200/umls-relations/_search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "size": 100,
  "query": {
    "bool": {
      "should": [
        { "terms": { "source_cui": ["C0018801", "C0018802"] } },
        { "terms": { "target_cui": ["C0018801", "C0018802"] } }
      ],
      "minimum_should_match": 1
    }
  },
  "sort": [
    { "rank": "asc" }
  ]
}

### Atomically publish a completed version.
POST http://127.0.0.1:9200/_aliases
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "actions": [
    { "remove": { "index": "*", "alias": "umls-search-documents", "must_exist": false } },
    { "add": { "index": "umls-search-documents-v1", "alias": "umls-search-documents" } },
    { "remove": { "index": "*", "alias": "umls-concepts", "must_exist": false } },
    { "add": { "index": "umls-concepts-v1", "alias": "umls-concepts" } },
    { "remove": { "index": "*", "alias": "umls-relations", "must_exist": false } },
    { "add": { "index": "umls-relations-v1", "alias": "umls-relations" } },
    { "remove": { "index": "*", "alias": "umls-search-details", "must_exist": false } },
    { "add": { "index": "umls-search-details-v1", "alias": "umls-search-details" } }
  ]
}
